Implemented the selected item-7 slice as **US-101 Month Advance Supabase Processing Store**.

Changed:
- Added `app/infrastructure/inngest/month-advance-supabase-store.ts`
  - Reads class-scoped `funds`, `asset_holdings`, pending current-month `tara_orders`, and `tracked_metrics`.
  - Maps provider rows into `ClassMonthAdvanceFundProcessingInput[]`.
  - Writes completed processing by upserting `simulation_ledger`, updating `funds.current_aum`, marking pending `tara_orders` as `processed`, and advancing `classes.current_month_index`.
  - Sanitizes read/write/row rejection failures.
- Added `app/infrastructure/inngest/month-advance-supabase-store.test.ts`
  - Covers row-to-input mapping, classroom sell concentration, malformed-row rejection, durable write mutation shape, and sanitized provider failures.
- Added story packet:
  - `docs/stories/US-101-month-advance-supabase-processing-store.md`
